OL,3,AUK in talks about joining global
OL,4,Adefence bank led by Canada
OL,5,
OL,6,FTreasury officials stressed that no
OL,7,Fdecision has been made. A government
OL,8,Fspokesperson said it was "fully
OL,9,Fcommitted to working alongside our
OL,10,Finternational partners to scale defence
OL,11,Findustrial capacity."
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
