OL,3,AAll support acts on Ed Sheeran's US
OL,4,Atour quit after Macklemore dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll of the remaining support acts on Ed
OL,7,FSheeran's US tour have quit, after the
OL,8,Frapper Macklemore was dropped from the
OL,9,Fline-up for making pro-Palestinian
OL,10,Fremarks on stage.
OL,12,FAmong them were Finneas, the brother of
OL,13,Fpop star Billie Eilish, who said in a
OL,14,Fstatement: "Artists must not be
OL,15,Fsilenced when they speak up for the
OL,16,Foppressed."
OL,18,FIrish singer-songwriter Aaron Rowe and
OL,19,FDanish band Lukas Graham also announced
OL,20,Ftheir departure. Irish folk band Beoga,
OL,21,Fwho perform with Sheeran on stage every
OL,22,Fnight, dropped out too.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
