OL,3,AIran war has led to US munitions
OL,4,Ashortfalls, Pentagon inspector confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US defence department's inspector
OL,7,Fgeneral says the war with Iran has led
OL,8,Fto "shortfalls" in munitions and a
OL,9,Fbottleneck in resupply, contradicting
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump who has
OL,11,Frepeatedly denied the US is facing
OL,12,Fshortages.
OL,14,FTrump has claimed US munitions supplies
OL,15,Fare "virtually unlimited" and said
OL,16,Freporting otherwise is "fake news".
OL,18,FBut the independent watchdog said the
OL,19,FUS spent more than $22 billion on
OL,20,Fmunitions from February through to
OL,21,FJune, leading to "strategic inventory
OL,22,Fshortfalls".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
