OL,3,AIran war has led to US munitions
OL,4,Ashortfalls, Pentagon inspector confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen asked about the watchdog's report,
OL,7,Fthe White House said the US had "more
OL,8,Fthan enough" munitions.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
